  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "India\u2019s contacts with the World have continued through ages but her
    relationships through the land routes are much older than her maritime contacts.
    The various passes across the mountains in the north have provided passages to
    the ancient travellers, while the oceans restricted such interaction for a long
    time."
